    "cf1": "Whittle is a spectral/periodogram likelihood (no normal-equations Gram); the CF-1 fp32-Gram pattern does not apply.",
    "contract": "RESOLVED at 4.6.5: GPU honors the SAME failure contract as CPU \u2014 all-fail raises ConvergenceError, partial -> NaN+warn, and a non-stationary AR is NEVER returned as a plain number (n_finite_ar_gt1 == 0 on every 'fit'). Host-side fp64 stationarity gate (R14, version-stable)."
